A fence that names its language:        
                                        
<Quiet>┌─ rust</>                                 
<Quiet>│ </><Keyword>fn</> <Name>main</>() {                           
<Quiet>│ </>    <Keyword>let</> value <Operator>=</> compute_something_long
<Quiet>┆ </>(argument_one, argument_two);         
<Quiet>│ </>}                                     
<Quiet>└─</>                                      
                                        
A fence that names nothing:             
                                        
<Quiet>┌─</>                                      
<Quiet>│ </><Quiet>plain block</>                           
<Quiet>└─</>                                      
                                        
And a block indented four spaces, after 
a blank line:                           
                                        
<Quiet>┌─</>                                      
<Quiet>│ </><Quiet>let x = 1;</>                            
<Quiet>│ </><Quiet>let y = 2;</>                            
<Quiet>└─</>                                      
                                        
The corpus ends here.
